Today is Thursday morning.
I go to Vikram's desk in the office.
Vikram is the software tester of our team.
We both sit together.
He explains his work to me.
"Maya, I have worked as a tester for five years," he says.
"I have tested many software applications."
Vikram is very smart at his work.
He has made a large test plan for the new project.
He shows me his computer.
"I have prepared this plan for your code," he says.
"I am going to check every part of the code carefully."
I read his plan carefully.
He has really done very good preparation.
"Vikram, you have made a very nice plan," I say.
"I hope there will not be many bugs in my code."
Vikram laughs and says, "We will see soon!"
